WEBVTT

00:06:57.329 --> 00:07:01.250
This way we can make BCI accessible
not to the thousands of people,

00:07:01.292 --> 00:07:04.128
but to the millions of people
who need this technology.

00:07:05.963 --> 00:07:09.925
So it wasn't easy, took us ten years,

00:07:09.967 --> 00:07:12.470
but I'm very excited to show you guys.

00:07:15.806 --> 00:07:17.933
We called this the Stentrode.

00:07:23.606 --> 00:07:30.446
(Applause)